Package: graft
Title: Reviewable Knowledge Changes for R Workflows
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "github@jameshwade.com")
Description: Turns candidate records from R workflows into reviewable,
    traceable knowledge changes. A compiled LinkML or data-dict contract
    governs identity and validation, a read-only plan makes proposed changes
    inspectable, and one atomic commit path records accepted revisions with
    provenance. Bounded retrieval and a managed Open Knowledge Format working
    tree provide derived views for people, agents, Git, and other tools.
